# Repo CLI (`hyp`)

Developer gates live in the Effect CLI under `dev/cli/`. Prefer it over adding new
`package.json` scripts.

```sh
pnpm hyp --help
pnpm verify          # alias → hyp verify
pnpm hyp check …     # individual gates
pnpm hyp docs …      # docs-site commands
```

## Green before commit

`pnpm verify` (or `pnpm hyp verify`) must pass:

deps → typecheck → lint → test → build → markers

- Do not add parallel one-off scripts for those gates — extend `dev/cli/` instead.
- Examples (`example:*`) stay outside `hyp` until rewritten one by one.
- Lifecycle (`prepare`, changesets, `version`, `release`) stays outside `hyp`.
- Standards manifest check needs `pnpm hyp docs install` first; it is **not** in default verify
  (`pnpm hyp check manifest` / `pnpm hyp docs manifest check`).
